# ClassGrid Marketing — Optimization Plan
**Goal**: Mobile optimization + Light mode, 2 pages/day, 2 weeks  
**Rule**: Each day → edit → test → commit → push ✅

---

## 📱 WEEK 1 — Mobile Optimization

### Day 1 — Support Core
| # | Page | File |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | `/support/ticket` | `app/support/ticket/page.tsx` |
| 2 | `/support/inquiry` | `app/support/inquiry/page.tsx` |

**Focus**: Form layout stacking on small screens, button sizes, input widths

---

### Day 2 — Support Portal
| # | Page | File |
|---|---|---|
| 3 | `/support/requests` | `app/support/requests/page.tsx` |
| 4 | `/support/requests/[id]` | `app/support/requests/[id]/page.tsx` |

**Focus**: Table → card view on mobile, reply editor toolbar wrapping

---

### Day 3 — Homepage + Pricing
| # | Page | File |
|---|---|---|
| 5 | `/` | `app/page.tsx` |
| 6 | `/pricing` | `app/pricing/` |

**Focus**: Hero section, feature grids, pricing card stacking

---

### Day 4 — Blog + Changelog
| # | Page | File |
|---|---|---|
| 7 | `/blog` | `app/blog/` |
| 8 | `/changelog` | `app/changelog/` |

**Focus**: Article cards, filter bar, timeline layout

---

### Day 5 — Compare + Case Studies
| # | Page | File |
|---|---|---|
| 9 | `/compare` | `app/compare/` |
| 10 | `/case-studies` | `app/case-studies/` |

**Focus**: Comparison table scrolling, editorial layout responsiveness

---

### Day 6 — About + Contact
| # | Page | File |
|---|---|---|
| 11 | `/about` | `app/about/` |
| 12 | `/contact` | `app/contact/` |

**Focus**: Team grid, mission sections, contact form layout

---

### Day 7 — Help Center + Legal
| # | Page | File |
|---|---|---|
| 13 | `/help-center` | `app/help-center/` |
| 14 | `/privacy` + `/terms` | `app/privacy/` + `app/terms/` |

**Focus**: Article layout, search bar, legal text readability on mobile

---

## ☀️ WEEK 2 — Light Mode Optimization

> Same page order as Week 1. Replace hardcoded dark colors with theme tokens.

**Key replacements**:
- `bg-zinc-900` → `bg-card`
- `bg-black` → `bg-background`
- `text-white` → `text-foreground`
- `text-zinc-400` → `text-muted-foreground`
- `border-zinc-800` → `border-border`
- `bg-[#141414]` → `bg-muted`

---

### Day 8 — Support Core (Light Mode)
- `/support/ticket` + `/support/inquiry`

### Day 9 — Support Portal (Light Mode)
- `/support/requests` + `/support/requests/[id]`

### Day 10 — Homepage + Pricing (Light Mode)
- `/` + `/pricing`

### Day 11 — Blog + Changelog (Light Mode)
- `/blog` + `/changelog`

### Day 12 — Compare + Case Studies (Light Mode)
- `/compare` + `/case-studies`

### Day 13 — About + Contact (Light Mode)
- `/about` + `/contact`

### Day 14 — Help Center + Legal (Light Mode)
- `/help-center` + `/privacy` + `/terms`

---

## ✅ Daily Checklist (Every Session)
- [ ] Open the 2 pages for today
- [ ] Test on mobile (Chrome DevTools → iPhone 14 / 375px width)
- [ ] Fix layout issues
- [ ] Switch to light mode and check colors
- [ ] `git add . && git commit -m "fix: mobile/light [page name]"`
- [ ] `git push`

